{
  "title": "Fleet — lans-h.cc",
  "uid": "lansh-fleet",
  "tags": ["platform", "observability"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "label": "Cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "query": "label_values(up, cluster)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Fleet overview / 機隊總覽",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Scrape targets — 0 means the collector cannot reach it",
      "description": "up{} per job. A target at 0 is a collection failure, not necessarily a dead workload.\n\nup{} 每個 job 一列。顯示 0 代表採集不到,不一定是該 workload 掛了。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 9, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "up{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} {{namespace}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red", "index": 0 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green", "index": 1 } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Fleet CPU (cores)",
      "description": "Sum of real containers only — container!=\"\" excludes the pod-level cgroup and container!=\"POD\" the pause container, which would otherwise double-count.\n\n只加總真正的 container:container!=\"\" 排除 pod 層級 cgroup、container!=\"POD\" 排除 pause container,否則會重複計算。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 5, "x": 9, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "cores"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1.2 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1.7 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Host memory available",
      "description": "node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes — the host figure, not the sum of containers. They never match: kernel, page cache, k3s and containerd live outside every container.\n\n主機數字,不是容器加總。兩者永遠對不起來 —— kernel、page cache、k3s、containerd 都不在任何容器裡。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 5, "x": 14, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1500000000 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 3000000000 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Load (1m)",
      "description": "2 OCPU, so sustained load1 above ~2 means the run queue is backing up.\n\n2 OCPU,所以 load1 持續高於約 2 代表 run queue 開始堆積。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 5, "x": 19, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "node_load1{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 2 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 4 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },

    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Per-app / 各 app",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU by namespace (cores)",
      "description": "namespace == app, because every app has its own. No per-app instrumentation needed.\n\nnamespace 就是 app —— 每個 app 各有自己的 namespace,所以不需要額外埋點。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (namespace) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 4,
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory by namespace (working set)",
      "description": "observability is expected to be the largest here — see README and pending.md 2.8. That is a known open item, not a misreading.\n\nobservability 目前預期是最大的一條 —— 見 README 與 pending.md 2.8。那是已知的未結案項目,不是看錯。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 7 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (namespace) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },

    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Disk / 磁碟",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Filesystem available — ALL THREE mountpoints",
      "description": "/var/lib/rancher (containerd) and /var/lib/containers (podman) are on their own volumes since docs/runbook-storage.md. Either filling up is INVISIBLE in / — watching / alone would stay green through a full image store.\n\n這兩個目錄已經拆成獨立卷,其中任一塞爆在 / 上完全看不出來。只看 / 的告警會在 image store 爆滿時一路顯示正常。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "node_filesystem_avail_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\", mountpoint=~\"/|/var/lib/rancher|/var/lib/containers\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{mountpoint}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "min"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Image store on disk — should be a SAWTOOTH",
      "description": "prune-images.timer runs daily at 03:00 and prunes both stores. A daily drop then regrowth as deploys land is healthy. A FLAT LINE means the timer is not firing — that is what this metric exists to catch.\n\nprune-images.timer 每日 03:00 清兩個 store。每日下降、隨部署回升是正常的。一條平線代表 timer 沒在跑 —— 這正是這個指標存在的意義。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "image_store_disk_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{store}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pod container logs, total",
      "description": "Written by the host systemd timer into node-exporter's textfile collector — NOT a Kubernetes metric. If this flatlines while deploys continue, the timer stopped.\n\n由 host 上的 systemd timer 寫進 node-exporter 的 textfile collector,不是 Kubernetes 指標。若持續部署但這條變平,就是 timer 停了。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "pod_log_total_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}",
          "legendFormat": "total"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      }
    },

    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Postgres (shared, db-per-app)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 26 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Database size per app",
      "description": "db-per-app, so datname IS the app. This data sits on a single local-path PVC with no redundancy and no backup — see pending.md 3.4.\n\ndb-per-app,所以 datname 就是 app。這些資料放在唯一一顆沒有備援、沒有備份的 local-path PVC 上 —— 見 pending.md 3.4。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 27 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "pg_database_size_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{datname}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Connections per database",
      "description": "Against Postgres's max_connections. Apps exhausting the pool shows up here before it shows up as an app error.\n\n對照 Postgres 的 max_connections。app 把連線池用光,會先在這裡看到,才會變成 app 的錯誤。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 27 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "pg_stat_database_numbackends{cluster=~\"$cluster\", datname!=\"\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{datname}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cache hit ratio",
      "description": "blks_hit / (blks_hit + blks_read). Below ~0.95 sustained means Postgres is going to disk more than it should — on a 12 GB node shared with everything else, that is a memory-pressure symptom.\n\n持續低於約 0.95 代表 Postgres 比應該的更常讀磁碟 —— 在一台 12 GB 且要分給所有東西的節點上,那是記憶體壓力的徵兆。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 27 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (datname) (rate(pg_stat_database_blks_hit{cluster=~\"$cluster\", datname!=\"\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum by (datname) (rate(pg_stat_database_blks_hit{cluster=~\"$cluster\", datname!=\"\"}[5m]) + rate(pg_stat_database_blks_read{cluster=~\"$cluster\", datname!=\"\"}[5m])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "{{datname}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 0, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },

    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Storage, certificates, and the collector itself / 儲存、憑證、採集器自身",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 36 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "PVC used — the Postgres volume",
      "description": "There is exactly one PVC on this cluster and it holds the shared Postgres. local-path, single node, no redundancy, no backup. This panel is the only view of it filling up.\n\n整個叢集只有一顆 PVC,裝的是共用 Postgres。local-path、單節點、沒有備援、沒有備份。這個 panel 是唯一看得到它填滿的地方。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 37 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "1 - (kubelet_volume_stats_available_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"} / kubelet_volume_stats_capacity_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{persistentvolumeclaim}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.75 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.85 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Certificate expiry (days)",
      "description": "cert-manager's own metric, scraped because cert-manager ships with the prometheus.io/scrape annotation. The one that matters is the *.lans-h.cc wildcard — it is Traefik's default cert, so every app Ingress depends on it.\n\ncert-manager 自己的指標。真正要緊的是 *.lans-h.cc wildcard —— 它是 Traefik 的預設憑證,每個 app 的 Ingress 都靠它。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 37 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "(certmanager_certificate_expiration_timestamp_seconds{cluster=~\"$cluster\"} - time()) / 86400",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 14 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 30 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Collector memory vs its 400Mi limit",
      "description": "Alloy's GOMEMLIMIT is derived from this limit (~90% of it), so the limit is not a number to lower casually — cutting it on a process near the ceiling buys an OOMKill, and an OOMKilled collector looks like a metrics gap, not an outage. Tracking item: pending.md 2.8.\n\nAlloy 的 GOMEMLIMIT 由這個 limit 推導(約 90%),所以不能隨手調低 —— 對逼近上限的行程收緊,換來的是 OOMKill,而被 OOMKill 的採集器看起來像「指標有缺口」不像「掛了」。追蹤:pending.md 2.8。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 37 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=\"observability\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 314572800 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 377487360 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    }
  ]
}
